{"id": "t030-002", "text": "rachel's dog Biscuit had a lump removed tues, waiting on biopsy results. she's barely sleeping", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had a lump removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tues", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t030-003", "text": "Callum got made redundant on Friday. Eleven years there. He says he's fine but he really isn't. I should take him for a pint next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Eleven years there", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-004", "text": "Just got off the phone with Shanice. Her nan passed away on Sunday morning, peacefully apparently. Funeral is provisionally 3rd of June in Leeds. Her mum is doing all the arrangements and Shanice is worried about her coping. Need to send flowers to her mum's house and ask Shanice if she wants me to drive her up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of June", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about her coping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to her mum's house", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Shanice if she wants me to drive her up", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t030-007", "text": "Note: Yusuf's dad's bypass went ahead 5/14, he's in ICU for a couple of days then on the ward. Yusuf flying back from Dubai on the 17th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bypass", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in ICU", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of days", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Dubai", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 17th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-011", "text": "Darius said his mother-in-law is coming out of hospital on 21/10 after the hip replacement and she's moving in with them for six weeks while she recovers. He sounded knackered, he's also covering for his boss who's off sick, so it's all landing on him at once. Their kids are giving up the spare room. Remind me to drop off a lasagne or something that week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming out of hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in with them", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she recovers", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off a lasagne", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-015", "text": "Anya's cat Luna is really poorly, kidney stuff. Vet said they might have to make a decision by the weekend. Anya is in bits. Must call her Sunday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Luna", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decision", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-017", "text": "Dictated: so Alana rang about her brother Theo, he came off his motorbike on the A road Saturday night, broken collarbone and some ribs, he's in Southmead and they think he'll be out by Wednesday. Alana's going down every evening. I should send something to the ward, maybe the F1 magazine he likes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "came off his motorbike", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken collarbone and some ribs", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Southmead", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something to the ward", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "F1 magazine", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t030-021", "text": "Ximena's parrot Coco is 30 next month! She's having a little party for it on Nov 8th, I'm invited. Coco likes sunflower seeds and swearing. Her partner Kaito built it a new perch for the occasion, apparently it took him three weekends and the bird ignores it completely.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot Coco", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 8th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weekends"}]}
{"id": "t030-024", "text": "Sara's new kitten is called Bean. Black with one white paw. Already destroyed her curtains", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new kitten is called Bean", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t030-025", "text": "Remember to ask Adriana how the scan went on 19 October. She was nervous about it all week.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Adriana how the scan went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "19 October", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}]}
{"id": "t030-027", "text": "Jen texted, Callum's mum had a fall and is in hospital with a broken wrist. Not serious but she's 89. They're visiting Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "89", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-029", "text": "Theo was let go from the agency, says it's a relief honestly. Wants to try freelance illustration, which he's been on about since uni. Has a portfolio review 3 Dec with a studio in Bristol and a meeting with an old client on the 10th. His girlfriend Chloe is a bit worried about money but backing him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "let go from the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants to try freelance illustration", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d0", "type": "DATE", "text": "since uni"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "portfolio review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 Dec", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting with an old client", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 10th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried about money", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t030-034", "text": "Ioana's grandad's 90th was meant to be December 3rd but they've called it off, he's back in hospital with pneumonia. Ioana's going over to Bucharest on the 1st to be with him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 3rd"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over to Bucharest", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-035", "text": "Aarav said the puppy cried every night for the first week, they've got her crate in the bedroom now. Vaccinations done on 10/10, can go on walks from next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aarav", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "puppy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night for the first week"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Vaccinations", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "10/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next week"}]}
{"id": "t030-036", "text": "Kalani's results came back clear!!! Her oncologist appointment was this morning. Send her something to celebrate — she's been wanting that Le Creuset pan forever.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "oncologist appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her something to celebrate", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting that Le Creuset pan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t030-039", "text": "Spoke to Anya after the vet. They had to put Luna to sleep Monday. She was 17. Anya's taking a couple of days off work. Ask her round for dinner next week, maybe Thursday, and get a card for her and her partner Kenji.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the vet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put Luna to sleep", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "couple of days off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her round for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card for her and her partner Kenji", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t030-040", "text": "Hoang is on the waiting list for hip surgery, could be months. Says he's in pain most days now. Works from home Mondays and Fridays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hoang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in pain most days", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works from home Mondays and Fridays", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t030-041", "text": "Dmitri's interview went really well, second round on Nov 6. He's nervous about the presentation part, has to present a case study to the whole board.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 6", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the presentation part", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t030-044", "text": "Marcus says the chemo is knocking him flat, the third round got postponed to 25 November because his bloods were low. His sister Dalia is staying with him for now, she's taken unpaid leave and is sleeping on his sofa, which can't be great for her back. Remind me to ring him before the 25th, and maybe sort a food delivery.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knocking him flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "third round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 25 November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "unpaid leave", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the 25th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a food delivery", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t030-045", "text": "Ximena got made redundant 31/10. Packing up her desk this week. Seems upbeat, already talking about going travelling in January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "31/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Packing up her desk", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going travelling", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t030-047", "text": "Dictation: Duc's grandma died Thursday, she was ninety four, he's flying to Hanoi for the funeral on the twentieth and won't be back until early December. His boss gave him compassionate leave. Remember to message him on the day of the funeral and ask if he needs anyone to water his plants while he's away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Hanoi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the twentieth", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until early December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "compassionate leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day of the funeral", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if he needs anyone to water his plants while he's away", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's away", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-048", "text": "Vera Mensah, met at Jen's. Vet nurse. Fosters greyhounds. Doesn't drink.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera Mensah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Vet nurse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Fosters greyhounds", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t030-053", "text": "Kenji's dog Haru's first birthday is Oct 28th, he's doing a pup cup at the park on the Saturday after. Get Haru a squeaky toy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Haru", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 28th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pup cup at the park", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get Haru a squeaky toy", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t030-057", "text": "Jen's sister is in for her C-section on the 6th of November. Twins! Jen's going up on the 4th, back the 12th. I'm feeding her cat Mango while she's away. Ask her for the spare key before she goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "C-section", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Twins", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mango", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she's away", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her for the spare key", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
